#api http test requests for VScode

### get cats

GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats

### get cat by id
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats/1

### post new cat
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats
Content-Type: application/json

  {
    "name": "Rolle",
    "birth_date": "10.22.2026",
    "weight": 6,
    "owner": "Minna",
    "img": "https://loremflickr.com/320/240/cat"
  }
